      "1": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "SWITCH\n\nThe Switch node enables you to switch between the different incomming values. The input selects the case that is sent out.\n\nExample:  The top Switch is controlled by the Choice In node, giving the user a drop-down menu to pick their value. The bottom Switch is controlled by the Bool In. This makes the Switch function like a typical light switch, true or false, on or off."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
